<section class="ac-card"><div class="ac-head"><div><h2>Creator applications</h2><p>Review real creator accounts, scanned evidence, and public visibility before approval.</p></div><button class="ac-btn" id="if-admin-refresh" type="button">Refresh</button></div><div class="ac-body" id="if-admin-message" role="status" hidden></div><div class="ac-table-wrap"><table class="ac-table"><thead><tr><th>Creator</th><th>Handle</th><th>Account</th><th>Verification</th><th>Submitted</th><th>Action</th></tr></thead><tbody id="if-admin-creators"><tr><td colspan="6">Loading creators…</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section class="ac-card mt-3" id="if-admin-detail" hidden><div class="ac-head"><h2 id="if-admin-detail-title">Creator review</h2></div><div class="ac-body"><p id="if-admin-profile"></p><h3>Documents</h3><div id="if-admin-documents"></div><div class="ac-field mt-3"><label for="if-admin-reason">Review note or rejection reason</label><textarea class="ac-textarea" id="if-admin-reason" maxlength="500" placeholder="Explain what needs to change or why the application is rejected."></textarea></div><div class="ac-actions mt-3"><button class="ac-btn primary" type="button" data-if-decision="approve">Approve creator</button><button class="ac-btn" type="button" data-if-decision="request_changes">Request changes</button><button class="ac-btn danger" type="button" data-if-decision="reject">Reject</button><button class="ac-btn" type="button" data-if-decision="suspend">Suspend active creator</button><button class="ac-btn" type="button" data-if-decision="reactivate">Reactivate</button></div></div></section>
<section class="ac-card mt-3"><div class="ac-head"><div><h2>Campaign management</h2><p>Create a campaign, then assign an approved creator a safe on-site referral destination.</p></div></div><div class="ac-body"><form id="if-admin-campaign-form" class="ac-form-grid"><div class="ac-field"><label>Campaign name<input class="ac-input" name="name" minlength="3" required></label></div><div class="ac-field"><label>Commission type<select class="ac-select" name="commission_type" required><option value="percent">Percent of order</option><option value="fixed">Fixed amount</option></select></label></div><div class="ac-field"><label>Commission value<input class="ac-input" name="commission_value" type="number" step="0.01" min="0.01" required></label></div><div class="ac-field"><label>Attribution window (days)<input class="ac-input" name="attribution_days" type="number" min="1" max="90" value="30" required></label></div><div class="ac-field"><label>Starts at<input class="ac-input" name="starts_at" type="datetime-local" required></label></div><div class="ac-field"><label>Ends at<input class="ac-input" name="ends_at" type="datetime-local" required></label></div><div class="ac-field"><label>Campaign status<select class="ac-select" name="status"><option value="draft">Draft</option><option value="active">Active</option></select></label></div><div class="ac-field"><label>Disclosure text<input class="ac-input" name="disclosure_text" value="Paid partnership with Conscious Indi." required></label></div><div class="ac-field" style="grid-column:1/-1"><label>Description<textarea class="ac-textarea" name="description" minlength="20" required></textarea></label></div><div style="grid-column:1/-1"><button class="ac-btn primary" type="submit">Create campaign</button></div></form><h3>Assign creator</h3><form id="if-admin-assign-form" class="ac-form-grid"><div class="ac-field"><label>Campaign<select class="ac-select" name="campaign_id" id="if-admin-campaign-select" required></select></label></div><div class="ac-field"><label>Approved creator<select class="ac-select" name="influencer_id" id="if-admin-creator-select" required></select></label></div><div class="ac-field"><label>Destination path<input class="ac-input" name="destination_url" value="/conscious/products.html" pattern="/(?!/).*" required></label></div><div style="align-self:end"><button class="ac-btn primary" type="submit">Assign and generate link</button></div></form><div id="if-admin-campaign-list" class="ac-table-wrap mt-3"></div></div></section>
<section class="ac-card mt-3"><div class="ac-head"><div><h2>Payout profiles</h2><p>Verify bank details using your approved offline checks. Only masked data is shown here.</p></div></div><div class="ac-table-wrap"><table class="ac-table"><thead><tr><th>Creator</th><th>Beneficiary</th><th>Bank / PAN</th><th>Status</th><th>Action</th></tr></thead><tbody id="if-admin-payout-profiles"><tr><td colspan="5">Loading…</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<div class="ac-card mt-3"><div class="ac-body ac-form-grid"><div class="ac-field"><label>Reason for rejection<input id="if-admin-payout-reason" class="ac-input" maxlength="500" placeholder="Required when rejecting a payout or withdrawal"></label></div><div class="ac-field"><label>Actual bank transfer reference<input id="if-admin-bank-reference" class="ac-input" maxlength="180" placeholder="Required only after sending money manually"></label></div></div></div>
<section class="ac-card mt-3"><div class="ac-head"><div><h2>Creator withdrawals</h2><p>Manually send payment outside this system, then enter the real bank reference to mark it paid.</p></div></div><div class="ac-table-wrap"><table class="ac-table"><thead><tr><th>Creator</th><th>Amount</th><th>Status</th><th>Requested</th><th>Reference</th><th>Action</th></tr></thead><tbody id="if-admin-withdrawals"><tr><td colspan="6">Loading…</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section class="ac-card mt-3"><div class="ac-head"><div><h2>Creator package reviews</h2><p>Review service terms and price before a package appears to vendors.</p></div><button class="ac-btn" id="if-admin-packages-refresh" type="button">Refresh packages</button></div><div class="ac-body"><p id="if-admin-packages-message" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div id="if-admin-packages"></div></div></section>
